// Bandit Level 11 → Level 12

URL: https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/

Step1: Log in to the Bandit Level 11 server using SSH:

        ssh bandit11@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step2: Enter the password obtained from Bandit Level 10.

Step3: List the files in the current directory:

        ls

Step4: A file named `data.txt` is present.

Step5: The contents of the file are encrypted using ROT13.

Step6: Use the `tr` command to replace each character with its ROT13 equivalent:

        cat data.txt | tr 'A-Za-z' 'N-ZA-Mn-za-m'

Step7: The output is the password required to log in to the next level, `bandit12`.

Step8: Use the obtained password to connect to the next level:

        ssh bandit12@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220

Step9: The Bandit Level 11 → Level 12 challenge is solved.

Step10: Congratulations!! you have solved this problem!!
